Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开启了地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You opened the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝就是最后一道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith was the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了她 我释放了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her, and I set Lucifer free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.41,0:00:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有嗜血的欲望吗 或者别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonesing for another hit of bitch blood or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是米迦勒之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the michael sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说我是剑是什么意思 - 你是米迦勒的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, I'm the sword - You're michael's weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是个皮囊 - 你就是皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a vessel - You're the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯·特纳 他也是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus Turner. He's a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好祈祷还有命回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm what you've got to look forward to if you survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有重病号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,以诺派印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enochian sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:01:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能让任何天使都无法发现你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll hide you from every angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}in creation, including Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦 都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen it was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jo did good out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你会这么生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,生气 生气根本毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry angry doesn't begin to touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指我去猎杀魔鬼还是指别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about me hunting or something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了恶魔而不是你的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose a demon over your own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再相信你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't think I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是这样吗 都三天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it been … like, three days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,得让他振奋起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to cheer him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者给他来个背部推拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll give him a back rub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做好心理准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have to wrap our heads around the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比这次可能难逃一难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Bobby might not just bounce back this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,信封里是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胸部的X光片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went to radiology.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,象吃了外形诡异的枪子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got some glamour shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让医生郁闷死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say the doctors are baffled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.41,0:02:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好 卡西也给你刻了一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, Cass carved you one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说一下恶魔的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在圣马丁医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh St. Martin's hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why. What are you …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真用上手机了 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cellphone, Cass really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候天使开始要与凡人联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do angels need to reach out and touch someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的天使现在都找不到你们了 所有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hidden from angels now … all angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be able to simply …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,前戏该够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough foreplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来开门见山 有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here and lay your damn hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点把我治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get healing … now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被赶出了天堂 天堂之力被废了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cut off from heaven and much of heaven's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再无所不能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certain things, I can do. Certain things, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.27,0:03:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说在我可能一辈子都烂在这椅子上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me you lost your mojo just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又正巧和你的能力说永别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get me stuck in this trap the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shove it up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他开始说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least he's talking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听得见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多 我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have much time. We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,求之不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算杀了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plan to kill Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你想来帮我一把吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.09,0:03:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 蠢货 那根本没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. it's foolish. it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 真是谢谢你的金玉良言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. well, thanks for the support.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我已经找到了解决之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe I have the solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒并非唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is someone besides Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人够格与路西法抗衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong enough to take on Lucifer …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至够格阻止天启降世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong enough to stop The Apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是将我复活又救你们到飞机上的那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who resurrected me and put you on that airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也正是这一切的缔造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who began everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find god.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第5季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他不在天堂 但他绝对就在某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't in heaven. he has to be somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如去新墨西哥州找找 听说他幻化为墨西哥薄饼神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try New Mexico. I hear he's on a tortilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他不在那些面包片上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not on any flatbread.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 呆子 即使上帝真的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, chuckles, even if there is a God,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么早就挂了 这还是比较好听的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is either dead … and that's the generous theory …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is out there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.19,0:04:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么他就是怕得缩到一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he's up and kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当起了缩头乌龟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And doesn't give a rat's ass about any others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己睁眼看看 如今已经大战在即了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look around you, man. the world is in the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.87,0:04:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确地说我们就没几天能活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are literally at the end of days here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他老却还能躲在一边袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's off somewhere drinking booze out of a coconut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吗 - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right? - Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来跟你讨论神学问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a theological issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是战略问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strategic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,得上帝者 得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}With God's help, we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是白日做梦 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pipe dream, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这星期我已经杀了俩天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed two angels this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猎杀同族 成了叛变者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hunted. I rebelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会沦落如此 这一切 都拜你所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I did it … all of it … for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:04:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,全因你的过失所致\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你老弟一手造就了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your brother destroyed the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我失去所有 换来的竟是一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I lost everything … for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你别在那儿义正严词地教训我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So keep your opinions to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你并不是来探病关怀我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't drop in just to tear us a new hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那您有何贵干呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来借东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did come for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}An amulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}An amulet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常罕有和强大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very rare, very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能感应到上帝的存在 并帮我找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns hot in god's presence. it'll help me find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说是上帝探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a god emf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全搞不懂你在说些啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我可没那玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓 是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.64,0:05:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,能借我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I borrow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 借给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 可以借你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别搞丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我彻底被扒干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. now I feel naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再跟你联络的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找到上帝了 记得让他捎条好腿给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you find god, tell him to send legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的皮带 用你的皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your belt. your belt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here … hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 该死的 能听清楚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, damn it, can you hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I need a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这次恶魔盯上我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems I'm up to my ass in demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的整个镇的人都被恶魔附了身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole damn town's infested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,通 拉多\N{\fnArial\fs30}pass rado.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,科罗拉多州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coloro… colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,科罗拉多州的河通镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}River pass, colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,河通镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}River pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruf… rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 这里是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, it's …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里？鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there, ruf… rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是进出的必经之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only road in or out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯是对的 恶魔锁定了这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus was right. demons got this place locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们要徒步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're hiking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦还真是络绎不绝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the hits just keep on coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦 这里怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen, what the heck's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.85,0:11:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real glad to see you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真应该对你这傻子开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The can of whup ass I ought to open on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能来个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't pick up a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋就不能让我安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you … allergic to giving me peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从鲁弗斯那儿才知道你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to find out that you're alive from rufus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 艾伦 - 你可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, ellen. - Yeah, you better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好把我弄成快速拨号 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better put me on speed dial, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.56,0:11:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,超出了我能独自处理的范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than I can handle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少恶魔在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many demons are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎整个镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much … whole town,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:12:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,除去死人和这些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minus the dead people and these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}End times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is sam and dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是来这里帮忙的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunters … here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这整件鬼事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys hip to this whole demon thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子的眼睛变黑了 她拿着砖块冲向我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife's eyes turned black. she came at me with a brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.65,0:12:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点让人拥抱超自然的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of makes you embrace the paranormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 赶上我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, catch us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑我知道的比你多一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt I know much more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯电话里说他正在城里调查征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus called … said he was in town investigating omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个镇突如其来的都发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, the whole town was possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和乔在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and jo were nearby …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和乔一起猎鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hunting with jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到这里 这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got here, and the place …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.34,0:13:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方就像你看到的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the place was like you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到鲁弗斯 然后我和乔就失散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't find rufus. then me and jo got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我找到你们的时候我要正出去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out looking when I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. we'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 这些人不能只坐在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, these people cannot just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在要带他们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get them out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那没那么容易 我曾经试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not that easy. i've been trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经做过一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already made a run for it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.05,0:13:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么？本来我们有20个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened there used to be 20 of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有我们3个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's three of us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道外面是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what it's like out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔们无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能掩护每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't be able to cover everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们每人都给枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we get everyone guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要那边的孕妇背把枪出门当兰博\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … are you gonna arm up baby bump over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一次射击越多的盐弹 就可以避开越多的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}More salt we can fire at once, more demons we can keep away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经过的时候这有一个体育用品商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a sporting-goods store we passed on mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.55,0:13:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌他们有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet they got guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go. what about …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.59,0:13:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果乔和鲁弗斯在那里 我们会把他们带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If jo and rufus are out there, we'll bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人上去就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有个人呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah. somebody's got to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,教他们使用枪支\N{\fnArial\fs30}and start to give them guns for the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾伦会的 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah ellen. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你留下来帮她 事情就简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna go a lot faster if you stay and help, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就一个人带着枪和盐去找乔和鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you go get guns and salt and look for jo and rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.01,0:14:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.08,0:14:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是不想我出去碰到恶魔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want me going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没有那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠近恶魔 - 我才没有那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Around demons. - I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿盐 你去拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the salt. you get the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.43,0:14:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起去拿盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 盐就在跟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能专业点么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we at least do this like professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解 我们再试次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, roger, try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.55,0:17:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道怎么用这支枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your way around a gun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪服过役呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.37,0:17:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,费卢杰（伊拉克城市） 去了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fallujah, two tours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来一年多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got back a little over a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿什么会什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.41,0:17:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才在超市里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:18:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些恶魔居然附体在青少年身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those demons were possessing teenagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不切开这些孩子们的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, i had to slit some kid's throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 萨姆 你必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sam. you had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I just … it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能像过去一样拯救这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish I could save people, like I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你是说像你过去沉溺于饮用恶魔血那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? you mean when you were all hopped up on demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想六神无主地坐在这里发呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sit here on my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿被困在外面某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter's out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果半小时内我没有回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not back in half an hour, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着这些人离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get these people out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.07,0:18:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我可以单独和你说几句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. hold on. can I talk to you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又想出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna go out there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去干点活打发时间没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, crap doesn't hit the fan with coffee breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 呆在这里让大家准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. Just stay here, get 'em ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会照顾好艾伦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll cover ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么就你能去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's it got to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我看一眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think i'll take one look at a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会突然忘乎所以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suddenly fall off the wagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像经过了这么多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if, after everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有得到教训似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}i haven't learned my lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:19:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的以为我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you actually think …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.89,0:19:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后一次看到她是在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where'd you see her last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和迪恩之间发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's up with you and dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不难察觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was hard not to notice …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些天你们兄弟到底碰到了什么诡异的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How different things are between you guys these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.61,0:19:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多糟糕的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of bad road there, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 某个女人爱上你了还是别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? some girl come between you or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅是工作上的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stresses of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和乔一起猎杀恶魔 有点让人吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of surprised … you and jo hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是总说她不能过这种生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't you always saying she couldn't hack the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.95,0:19:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果她执意要这么做的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she's gonna do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.59,0:19:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想亲自照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:19:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个烟囱是在冒烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a chimney going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似我们找到他们的老巢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we found base camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.59,0:20:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔不会感到寒冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons don't get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪 他们在烧什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you wonder what they're burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.21,0:20:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 臭娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move, you evil skank!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害她 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you hurt her. don't you …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我妈妈回来 你这黑眼婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my mom back, you black-eyed bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen! run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you now, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.13,0:21:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是挣脱不了这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way you're getting out of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总算是上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you up myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我预期的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stuck right where I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.91,0:22:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狗娘养的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You evil son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.09,0:22:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just … just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶和华是我的牧者 我必不至缺乏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lord is my shepherd. I shall not want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他使我躺卧在青草地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He layeth me down in green pastures,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他再次拯救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he raiseth me up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然行过死荫的幽谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea, though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不怕遭害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall fear no evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.36,0:22:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.16,0:22:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们抓了他么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:22:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔们抓住了他么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.24,0:23:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在这里怎么办 那些恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they're in here … the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.01,0:23:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能进来么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could they get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.94,0:23:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都紧张起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.69,0:23:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该定个计划先 把所有情况都跟我说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we need to get a plan together. tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这事有点不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没搞错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.62,0:23:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么没用 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why isn't it working. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 这事有些古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, listen to me. something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.19,0:23:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可没自己想象的那么坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not as strong as he thinks he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.59,0:23:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.46,0:23:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.13,0:24:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 乔也被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, one of them's in jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.77,0:24:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把她安全地救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get it out without hurting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.03,0:24:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它竟然叫我婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It called me a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.77,0:24:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也太脆弱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruise a little easy, don't you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我不是那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它叫我黑眼婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It called me a black-eyed bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.81,0:24:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算是哪门子恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of demons are these.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣水和盐都没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy water and salt roll right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.42,0:24:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿也许是个傻子 但是她不笨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter may be an idiot, but she's not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.45,0:24:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带着反附身的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wears an anti-possession charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有点奇怪了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all kind of weird, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的事都不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.76,0:24:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.99,0:24:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}My instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.76,0:24:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该打给鲍比或者萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}My instinct is to call bobby and ask for help. or sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.70,0:24:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 那倒是麻烦了 这里就我俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tough. all you got's me, and all I got's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.30,0:24:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道鲁弗斯为什么来这个镇么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why rufus came to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么特别的预兆么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a specific omen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.81,0:24:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有说些跟水有关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said something about water.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.45,0:24:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.25,0:24:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父 你知道什么跟水有关的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Padre, you know what she's talking about … the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.95,0:24:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,河 河突然被污染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The river … ran polluted all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.75,0:24:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个礼拜三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天就有恶魔出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the demon thing started up the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有有别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.66,0:25:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有是有 不过挺像随机事件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. but it's pretty random.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.30,0:25:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有随机事件是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. random's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.63,0:25:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,流星 这算么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shooting star … does that count.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.54,0:25:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常大 同一晚 周三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real big. Same night … Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对算数\N{\fnArial\fs30}That definitely counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.45,0:25:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这是外太空来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you think that all this comes from outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.86,0:25:34.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,这可不是《X档案》 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't X Files, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.16,0:25:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有烧着的大星\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there fell a great star from heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像火把从天上落下来 落在江河上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning like a torch, and it fell upon the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这星名叫“苦堇”\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the name of the star was Wormwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.07,0:25:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有许多人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And many men died.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.40,0:25:50.04,Title,0,0,0,0,,《启示录》八章十节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revelation 8: 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.11,0:25:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是 这是天启的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that this is about the Apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.08,0:25:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些预兆 是什么的前兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these specific omens … they're prelude to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.28,0:26:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The four horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.55,0:26:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑红马的是哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And which one rides the red horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.05,0:26:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.52,0:26:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,主道上停的那辆红色野马\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cherry Mustang parked on main.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会认为天启骑士驾的是车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't think that a car…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.39,0:26:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我就这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the way I'd roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都对的上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.00,0:26:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果战争化成人形来到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}If War is a dude and he's here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.80,0:26:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是他在作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's messing with our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们彼此为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turning us on each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.47,0:26:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说乔叫你黑眼睛婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said Jo called you a black-eyed bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.37,0:26:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为我们是恶魔 我们以为他们是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think we're demons. We think they're demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.21,0:26:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果根本没有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there are no demons at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.51,0:26:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在互相残杀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're all just killing each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.08,0:26:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 慢点儿说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … just back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.65,0:26:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.51,0:26:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.73,0:26:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.26,0:26:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.27,0:26:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜中了 变个人形来看热闹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caught me. Popped in to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有这本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hustle like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.34,0:27:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里人人都认识的罗杰 真的罗杰哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the Roger everyone around here knows … the real Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.28,0:27:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋在沟里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buried in a ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.68,0:27:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.76,0:27:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给个提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到过德国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后又到过一次德国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.83,0:27:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再到中东\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then in the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.03,0:27:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到传呼的时候 我正在苏丹达尔福尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in Darfur when my beeper went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.57,0:27:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等待和我的兄弟重聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting to hook up with my siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有三个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got three.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.07,0:27:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一起会玩得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have so much fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.14,0:27:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇上根本就没有恶魔 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't any demons in town, are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.35,0:27:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.88,0:27:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是恐慌的人们割了彼此的喉咙罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just frightened people ripping each other's throats out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.39,0:27:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要做的其实并不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really haven't had to do too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.35,0:27:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边毁座桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out a bridge here, lay in a.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.95,0:27:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边施一点儿幻术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little hallucination there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.46,0:27:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下拿着爆米花 看好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit back, pop some corn, watch the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.23,0:27:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 你们这些小动物真邪恶呢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, you're really vicious little animals, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.83,0:27:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.03,0:27:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.07,0:28:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.17,0:28:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一周 这里还是世外桃源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week, this was Mayberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就已经到了屠戮幼童的地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now these people are stabbing each other's children.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.24,0:28:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你让他们视彼此为恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you made them see demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句实在话 人类自相残杀是不需要理由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, people don't need a reason to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.84,0:28:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 想想爱尔兰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you seen the Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不都是爱尔兰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.85,0:28:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.35,0:28:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是派对上的果冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm jello shots at a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.03,0:28:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人们放下禁制而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just remove inhibitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要亲手杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.83,0:28:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是太好了 你可是我的代表作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's adorable, considering you're my poster boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.73,0:28:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自从那晚看见那刀刃上滴着的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop thinking about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一直都忘不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since you saw it dripping off the blade of that knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.07,0:28:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.41,0:28:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证留着给你哥哥听吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save your protests for your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到你心中所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see inside your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.85,0:28:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的欲望单纯得很呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, man, it is one-track city in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.65,0:28:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,血 血 血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood, blood, blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.43,0:28:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对力量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.16,0:28:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}For power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.83,0:29:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.26,0:29:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想再次强大起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be strong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.03,0:29:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是一般的强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not just strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.23,0:29:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是强于任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger than everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿望很美好 但你是自寻死路 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good intentions … quick slide to hell, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.24,0:29:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你现在不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel bad now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.98,0:29:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆会儿你就可以享用大餐了嗜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you're thigh-deep in warm corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.15,0:29:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 好戏才刚开场呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, my friend, i'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.53,0:29:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,荤宴开始咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime for the meat suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.53,0:29:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好欣赏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.69,0:29:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说恶魔要来了 要来抓我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said they're coming! he said they're coming to get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.46,0:30:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 乔 鲁弗斯 他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. jo, rufus, he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.42,0:30:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.13,0:30:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊 乔 他在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! jo! he's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.29,0:30:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说根本没恶魔这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now you're saying that there are no demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.70,0:30:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人在作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that war is a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前可不是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believed crazy before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.14,0:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up! let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.84,0:30:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.44,0:30:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现那些恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw them … the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.94,0:30:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道我们要逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know we're trying to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.35,0:30:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我们谁都不可能逃脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they're gonna pick us off one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.75,0:30:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. what.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.05,0:30:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才还说没有恶魔的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said there were no demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.35,0:30:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只说这里没有 你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not. where did you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人出去侦查吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought someone should go out and see what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.29,0:30:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪看见恶魔的 他们说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you see the demons, and what did they say exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.09,0:30:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这是坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just sit here, we're gonna be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.32,0:30:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.83,0:30:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀死我们的 除非我们先下手为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill us … unless we kill them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.99,0:30:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,打住 打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on. hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.03,0:30:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 老兄 我们还得保护他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, we got people to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.56,0:30:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 身强力壮的人跟我走 去猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the able-bodied go, hunt some demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.83,0:30:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别操之过急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. slow your roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.87,0:30:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事就和恶魔无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a demon thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.01,0:30:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看他们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at their eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.04,0:30:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.15,0:31:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.71,0:31:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望一切都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope those are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.05,0:31:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两人说不定从一开始就被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two could have been demons the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.31,0:31:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前用的盐和圣水… 在我看来 全他妈是屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this salt and holy-water talk … as far as i'm concerned, it's all crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.73,0:31:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你死就是我亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them or us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.35,0:31:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在厨房里看到有一些刀可以用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw some knives in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.31,0:31:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.10,0:31:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.01,0:31:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.24,0:31:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.81,0:31:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆破筒对恶魔没有杀伤力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pipe bombs won't kill a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.91,0:31:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.95,0:31:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in my experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果恶魔的肉身少了腿的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons come at you slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.11,0:31:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就快不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're in a body with no limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.25,0:31:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我母亲也在他们那\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them is in my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.25,0:32:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 听着 你知道我会竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo, listen to me. you know i'm gonna do everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.85,0:32:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.73,0:32:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要她别从窗户进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless she comes through that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.84,0:32:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.01,0:32:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,低下身 脚步放慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay low. move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.29,0:33:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.20,0:33:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我听着 乔安娜·贝丝·哈维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you listen up, joanna beth harvelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.54,0:33:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. i'm not a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.15,0:33:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想 鲁弗斯 所有的征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, rufus. all those omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.98,0:33:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.06,0:33:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.29,0:33:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,被污染的水 还有那流星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The polluted water, the shooting star,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.69,0:33:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及红马 大战开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The red mustang … it's war.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.56,0:33:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 大战开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, it's war.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.96,0:33:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn right it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.97,0:34:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是天启四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horseman!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.17,0:34:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horseman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.31,0:34:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他让我们倒戈相向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. he's turning us against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.21,0:34:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是你的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.72,0:34:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horseman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.62,0:34:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.65,0:34:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.06,0:34:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己弄清真相的吗？大天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you figure this out all by yourself, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.44,0:34:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都搞定了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.21,0:34:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.38,0:34:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.91,0:34:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得找到战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay we got to find war.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止小镇居民互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before everybody in this town kills each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.59,0:34:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.22,0:34:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆呢？- 在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Sam? - Upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.19,0:34:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.66,0:34:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 你们三个从背后迂回\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - You three go around back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.89,0:35:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,从小巷走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.03,0:35:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不是恶魔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. it's not demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.40,0:35:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是天启四骑士的战争 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's war. - War.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.93,0:35:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不明白他是怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't figure out how he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.50,0:35:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.30,0:35:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指 没错 就是戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ring. the ring … that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.04,0:35:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要一转戒指 所有人都产生了幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned it right before he made everybody hallucinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.18,0:35:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像看见了恶魔 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And go hellbitch. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.81,0:35:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得出去 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to move. come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.57,0:35:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 都停火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.87,0:35:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止射击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.47,0:35:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.98,0:35:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是上了年纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.63,0:36:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信你的眼睛 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not what you think, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.76,0:36:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 摁住这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on, keep t.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.90,0:36:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经说了停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop firing usually means stop firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.71,0:37:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是把精巧的小刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a sweet little knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.35,0:37:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 有点常识好不\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.62,0:37:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀不了我的 兔崽子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill war, kiddos.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.62,0:37:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.85,0:37:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 离世界末日还有一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, pit stop on mount doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.70,0:38:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.32,0:38:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 别来这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, let's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.33,0:38:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听着 这至关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen. this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.50,0:38:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.60,0:38:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也渐渐意识到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just now I realize something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.91,0:38:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我也无法信任自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.71,0:38:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一看到那鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the minute I saw that blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.11,0:38:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑海里回闪的只有那可怕的念头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only thought in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.59,0:38:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不听说服自己 我的出发点是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I tell myself it's for the right reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.42,0:38:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我旨在行善\N{\fnArial\fs30}My intentions are good,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.92,0:38:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这种感觉是千真万确的 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it … it feels true, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.66,0:38:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我觉得 在那表面下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think, underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.90,0:38:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是忽视了什么重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}i just miss the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.60,0:38:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how messed up that sounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如同现在 我把一切都搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means I know how messed up I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.58,0:38:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键问题并不在于我体内的恶魔血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, the problem's not the demon blood … not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.18,0:38:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能把我的所作所为怪罪于露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}An, what I did, i can't blame the blood or ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.45,0:38:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是其他任何人 任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.93,0:39:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我自己造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.29,0:39:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我执迷不悟\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far i'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.08,0:39:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体内的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.97,0:39:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我感到恐惧不安 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}scares the hell out of me, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.11,0:39:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再去猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in no shape to be hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.68,0:39:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须退出 因为我本身太危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to step back, 'cause I'm dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.99,0:39:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 我们最好还是分开行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe's best we just go out spearate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.73,0:39:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我觉得你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.78,0:39:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜疑是最大的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspecting a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.94,0:39:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 要我花费更多的精力担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turth is I spent more time worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.00,0:39:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是怎样处理好眼下的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And about doing a job right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.98,0:39:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我做不到这样 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}how just I can't for that, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.57,0:40:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在现今的局势下不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.50,0:40:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.67,0:40:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you are, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.24,0:40:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.30,0:40:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't taking Impala?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.94,0:40:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.90,0:40:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care yourself, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.60,0:40:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you too, sammy.
